msgstr "Theip ar an gcur leis: %s"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1242
msgid ""
"Added to the running qosify at once and not saved: an entry expires after "
"its timeout (the defaults timeout when left empty) and a qosify restart "
"drops it. One on a match from the rules file overrides it until then."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear leis an qosify atá ag rith láithreach bonn, gan é a shábháil: téann "
"iontráil in éag tar éis an ama teorann a bhaineann léi (úsáidtear na "
"luachanna réamhshocraithe mura sonraítear aon rud), agus scriostar í má "
"athchóirítear an qosify. Má bhíonn meaitseáil ann de réir an chomhaid "
"rialacha, beidh an riail sin i réim thar an iontráil go dtí go rachaidh sí "
"in éag."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1210
msgid ""
"Adds a line to the editor below; Save & Apply writes it to the rules file, "
"so it is kept."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann sé líne leis an eagarthóir thíos; scríobhann Sábháil agus Cuir i "
"bhFeidhm í sa chomhad rialacha, ionas go gcoimeádtar í."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:85
msgid "Adds atm, noatm or ptm when overhead_type is manual"
msgstr "Cuireann sé atm, noatm nó ptm leis nuair is manual é overhead_type"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:87
msgid "Adds ether-vlan once per level (1 or 2)"
msgstr "Cuireann ether-vlan leis uair amháin in aghaidh an leibhéil (1 nó 2)"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:86
