#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1064
msgid ""
"DSCP codepoints: CS0–CS7, AF11–AF43, EF, VA, NQB, LE, DF (NQB needs qosify "
"from June 2026; 24.10 and 25.12 do not have it). A raw value from 0 to 63 is "
"accepted too, and any dscp_* value may also name a class. Prefix with + to "
"override only when the DSCP field is zero."
msgstr ""
"Pointí cóid DSCP: CS0–CS7, AF11–AF43, EF, VA, NQB, LE, DF (teastaíonn "
"*qosify* le haghaidh NQB ón Meitheamh 2026; níl sé ar fáil i 24.10 ná i "
"25.12). Glactar le luach amh idir 0 agus 63 freisin, agus féadfaidh aon "
"luach *dscp_** rang a shainiú chomh maith. Cuir + roimhe chun an socrú a "
"shárú ach amháin nuair atá an réimse DSCP cothrom le nialas."

