#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:675
msgid ""
"You have read-only access to this page, so editing and service control are "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Tá rochtain léite amháin agat ar an leathanach seo, mar sin tá an t-"
"eagarthóireacht agus rialú na seirbhíse díchumasaithe."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1563
msgid ""
"Zero qosify's own counters (get_stats)? The CAKE tin counters belong to tc "
"and are kept."
msgstr ""
"An ndéantar cuntair inmheánacha qosify (get_stats) a athshocrú go nialas? "
"Baineann na cuntair CAKE le tc agus coinnítear iad."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:944
msgid "active"
msgstr "gníomhach"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1969
msgid ""
"bandwidth_down does not look like a tc rate (100mbit, 12MBps, unlimited) — "
"passing it through anyway"
msgstr ""
"Ní cosúil gur ráta tc é bandwidth_down (100mbit, 12MBps, gan teorainn) — á "
"chur ar aghaidh mar sin féin"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1968
msgid ""
"bandwidth_up does not look like a tc rate (100mbit, 12MBps, unlimited) — "
"passing it through anyway"
msgstr ""
"Ní cosúil gur ráta tc é bandwidth_up (100mbit, 12MBps, gan teorainn) — á "
"chur ar aghaidh mar sin féin"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1055
msgid ""
"config device takes the same options, with name set to a netdev. nat "
"defaults to 1 for interfaces and 0 for devices."
msgstr ""
"Glacann config device leis na roghanna céanna, agus an t-ainm socraithe mar "
"netdev. Is é 1 an réamhshocrú do nat i gcás comhéadan, agus is é 0 é i gcás "
"feistí."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:943
msgid "device %s"
msgstr "gléas %s"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:945
msgid "device: %s, ingress: %s, egress: %s"
msgstr "gléas: %s, ionchur: %s, aschur: %s"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:317
msgid ""
"disabled is set to \"%s\" — config_get_bool does not recognise that, so the "
"section stays enabled"
msgstr ""
"Tá disabled socraithe ar \"%s\" — ní aithníonn config_get_bool é sin, mar "
"sin fanann an rannán cumasaithe"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1290
msgid "dump did not answer."
msgstr "Níor fhreagair dump."

